{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18388","headline":"曲池洁寒流 · 崔立之","name":"曲池洁寒流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲寻欹岸步，因向曲池看。\n透底何澄彻，回流乍屈盘。\n稍随高树古，迥与远天寒。\n月入镜华转，星临珠影攒。\n纤鳞时蔽石，转吹或生澜。\n愿假涓微效，来濡拙笔端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔立之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}